2026-09-28 11:17 · ACCEPTED · Add Directory.Build.props (VerusLLC had none): net10.0, Nullable, ImplicitUsings, TreatWarningsAsErrors · set once instead of per csproj across 3 projects · VerusLLC review (T0)
